// ============================================================================
// AIPL UNIVERSAL MULTI-INSTANCE, MULTI-TARGET, MULTI-PLAYER HEBAR BOT & REFEREE
// (`aipl_hebar_bot/hebar_bot.aipl`)
// ============================================================================
// Universal Human-Equivalent Bot Automated Referee & Self-Improving Verification
// Engine across all 4 AIPL compilation targets:
//   1. aipl   (JIT / Bytecode / Source execution)
//   2. native (Compiled C99 / X11 ELF binary)
//   3. html   (Standalone HTML5 + Canvas2D + WebGL2 bundle)
//   4. wasm   (WebAssembly binary + Browser / WASI host)
//
// Enforces the Five Inviolable HEBAR Human-Equivalence Standards per seat:
//   1. FIFO Reaction Latency Queue (150.0ms <= tau <= 250.0ms; 9..15 frames)
//   2. Input Frequency Clamp (<= 15.0 Hz; minIntervalMs >= 66.67ms / >= 4 frames)
//   3. Angular Turning Velocity Clamp (|dTheta/dt| <= 2*pi rad/s across [-pi, +pi])
//   4. Smooth Cursor Interpolation & Zero State Tampering (<= 780 px/s; 0 teleports)
//   5. Campaign Longevity & Anti-Stall Softlock Guard (maxIdleFrames < 120)
// ============================================================================

